# Security policy

Please do not publish sensitive details in a public issue. Send a minimal
description and a reproducible example through the repository's private
security contact. Remove credentials and personal data from all diagnostics.

Supported versions and private reporting contact are decided by the team that
owns this generated service. A generated project is not automatically covered
by the scaffold repository's support promise.

For usage questions, see [SUPPORT.md](SUPPORT.md). Do not publish credentials,
private URLs, customer data or exploit details in an issue.
